      "body": "@susjunyou Could you help review this follow-up to ASFT (#10174)? With `predict_with_generate=False`, the first scheduled evaluation crashes because `Trainer.prediction_step()` requests `(loss, outputs)` but the ASFT override returns only the scalar loss. The fix preserves the training objective and supports the existing `return_outputs` contract.\n\nThe description includes the original-code failures, seven passing offline tests on Transformers 4.55.0 and 5.8.0, and a Qwen3-0.6B CLI smoke test completing both scheduled evaluations on an RTX 5090. These are the previously recorded results for the unchanged implementation, not a new full-suite run.\n\n@hiyouga The four workflows on current head `8db76d9` still require approval. Could you approve them and help route the review if another maintainer owns this path? Thank you.\n",
